From: xiaobao <xiaobao@local>
Subject: [PATCH] es8323: fix DAC DAPM stream-name to match codec DAI playback stream

On Neardi LZ200 (RK3576) the es8323 codec is driven by the Rockchip
"multicodecs-card" machine driver. The codec DAI publishes
.playback.stream_name = "Playback" and the AIF_IN widget is declared with
sname = "Playback", but the Left/Right DAC DAPM widgets are declared with
sname = "Left Playback" / "Right Playback".

Because no widget in the playback path carries the exact stream name
"Playback" at the DAC endpoints, ASoC DAPM never activates the DAC widgets
when a "Playback" stream starts. The DAC widgets therefore stay powered
down (ES8323_DACPOWER = 0xc0, bits 7/6 = 1 = power down with invert=1),
which keeps the whole Headphone path (DAC -> Mixer -> OUT1 -> LOUT1 ->
Headphone pin) disconnected. Result: 3.5mm headphone is completely silent
even though hp-con / Headphone Jack detection are correct.

Android 14 on the same board works because its es8323 DAC widgets use the
matching sname. Fix by aligning the DAC widget sname with the DAI stream
name "Playback" (same approach the earlier broken 0006 hack attempted for
the sname, but 0006 also forced DACPOWER to SND_SOC_NOPM + hardcoded 0xc0
which kept the DAC permanently off — that part is deliberately NOT done
here; we keep the proper invert-controlled DACPOWER so DAPM powers the DAC
up correctly to 0x30 on playback).

Verified on LZ200 (board 192.168.60.174): with this change the playback
path powers up (ES8323_DACPOWER -> 0x30), Headphone PIN enables via jack
detect and mc_hp_event raises hp-con, and 1kHz test tone is audible.

--- a/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
@@ -270,9 +270,9 @@ static const struct snd_soc_dapm_widget es8323_dapm_widgets[] = {
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_ADC("Right ADC", "Right Capture", ES8323_ADCPOWER, 4, 1),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_ADC("Left ADC", "Left Capture", ES8323_ADCPOWER, 5, 1),
 
 	/* gModify.Cmmt Implement when suspend/startup */
-	SND_SOC_DAPM_DAC("Right DAC", "Right Playback", ES8323_DACPOWER, 6, 1),
-	SND_SOC_DAPM_DAC("Left DAC", "Left Playback", ES8323_DACPOWER, 7, 1),
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_DAC("Right DAC", "Playback", ES8323_DACPOWER, 6, 1),
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_DAC("Left DAC", "Playback", ES8323_DACPOWER, 7, 1),
 
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_AIF_OUT("I2S OUT", "Capture",  0, SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_AIF_IN("I2S IN", "Playback", 0, SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0),
